<title>NEW ZEALAND: ASB Bank NZ lifts 6 mth tax paid operating profit.</title>
<headline>ASB Bank NZ lifts 6 mth tax paid operating profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>ASB Bank Group said on Wednesday strong growth and further increases in market share had lifted its after-tax operating profit to NZ$40.4 million for the six months to December 31, against NZ$33.3 million for the corresponding period in 1995.</p>
</text>
